// A call through a variable of function type. The variable is an IdFn* under
// its own name; its `fn` is called as the type the variable's own type spells,
// with the object first (c_clo_ptr), so each argument converts to its
// parameter's type exactly as it would at a call to id_NAME, and a plain
// function and a closure are called the same way.
// The strict fingerprint pass and then the import-duplicate table over an
// empty prog, for the import-duplicate scan's own "nothing to compare" cases.
lz_empty() {
  fwd_env();
  uq_fill();
  imd_fill();
} return void;
